### 1. Register User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "user",
  "phone": "9800000000"
}

### 2. Register Garage Owner
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Garage Owner",
  "email": "owner@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "garage_owner",
  "phone": "9800000001"
}

### 3. Login Owner (Copy Token for below reqs)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Create Garage Profile (Needs Owner Token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/garages
Authorization: Bearer <OWNER_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Super Fast Garage",
  "phone": "9812345678",
  "address": "Kathmandu, Nepal",
  "coordinates": [85.3240, 27.7172]
}

### 5. Find Nearby Garages (Test Geospatial Query)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/garages/nearby?lng=85.32&lat=27.71&maxDistance=5000

### 6. Create Booking (Test Immediate Service - Needs User Token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer <USER_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "garageId": "<GARAGE_ID_FROM_STEP_4>",
  "type": "immediate",
  "issueLocation": {
    "type": "Point",
    "coordinates": [85.3220, 27.7150],
    "address": "Thamel"
  },
  "notes": "Flat tire on the main road."
}
